//@version=6
indicator("Heikin Ashi Oscillator Trend Engine ", "HA OSC💥", overlay=false, calc_bars_count=2500)


//  Heikin ASHI FUNCTION SOURCE
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
//  This script incorporates a Heikin Ashi calculation function adapted from
//  open-source work by @SimpleCryptoLife in his indicator "Better Heikin Ashi" (v4).
//  ➡️https://www.tradingview.com/v/Sz73I1P6/
//  ➡️https://simplecrypto.life/free-scripts/
//
//  His work showed how Heikin Ashi values can smooth price structure and make
//  directional shifts easier to read without requiring a full chart-type change.
//
//  In this script, that HA foundation is extended beyond candle visualization
//  and repurposed into a standalone oscillator engine. The resulting output uses
//  Heikin Ashi-derived values as the base for normalization, smoothing, and
//  momentum-style interpretation in a separate pane.
//
//
//  Heikin ASHI NOTES (adapted from @SimpleCryptoLife concepts)
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
//  • Heikin Ashi can smooth noisy price behavior and make directional movement
//    easier to read.
//  • HA direction changes can suggest reversal risk, pauses, or continuation,
//    but they are not stand-alone trade signals.
//  • In this script, HA is used as the foundation for a separate oscillator,
//    not as a replacement for the chart's real price.
//  • The oscillator is designed to help visualize momentum, directional pressure,
//    and general trend behavior from HA-derived inputs.
//  • Because these are derived values, they should be used with price structure,
//    support/resistance, volume, and other confirmation tools.
//  • Confirmed historical values do not repaint after bar close.
//    Live bars may still update while they are forming.
//
//  DISCLAIMER
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
//  • For educational and informational purposes only.
//  • Not financial advice.
//  • You are fully responsible for your own trading decisions.
//  • Always test and validate before using real money. Bar replay is a great tool 💥
// ==============================================================================

// ================================================================================
// 🟢 REGION: Core Imports
// ================================================================================
//
// 📌 Purpose:
//     Loads the SimpleCryptoLife higher-timeframe helper used to stabilize
//     requested HTF oscillator values inside a lower-timeframe pane.
//
// ================================================================================

import SimpleCryptoLife/HighTimeframeSampling/4  as SCL_HTF
import SimpleCryptoLife/LibraryTimeframeHelper/1 as TF

// ================================================================================
// 🔴 END REGION: Core Imports
// ================================================================================

