     "• Dynamic:\n" +
     "  The script chooses the lookback automatically based on the chart timeframe.\n\n" +
     "• Manual:\n" +
     "  The script uses your Manual Lookback value instead.\n\n" +
     "Lower lookbacks react faster.\n" +
     "Higher lookbacks react more slowly."

const string TT_MANUAL_LOOKBACK =
     "Sets the exact number of bars used in the lookback window when Lookback Mode = Manual.\n\n" +
     "Examples:\n" +
     "• 55 = the last 55 bars\n" +
     "• 144 = the last 144 bars\n" +
     "• On a 5-minute chart, 144 bars ≈ 12 hours\n" +
     "• On a 1-hour chart, 144 bars ≈ 6 days\n" +
     "• On a 1-hour chart, 55 bars ≈ 2.3 days\n\n" +
     "Smaller values make the oscillator more reactive.\n" +
     "Larger values make it smoother and slower."

const string TT_USE_CLAMP =
